BIP 2018 Q3","e":"bip","d":"2018-11-02","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bahir Manios","x":"Results were positively impacted by higher tariffs charged at each one of our operating groups.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/02/brookfield-infrastructure-partners-lp-bip-q3-2018.aspx"},{"c":"BIP 2018 Q3","e":"bip","d":"2018-11-02","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Samuel J. B. Pollock","x":"Headlines were dominated by concerns over a global trade war, volatility in the capital markets as a result of rising interest rates, political uncertainties with respect to Brexit negotiations and of course, elections in South America.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/02/brookfield-infrastructure-partners-lp-bip-q3-2018.aspx"},{"c":"BIP 2018 Q4","e":"bip","d":"2019-02-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bahir Manios","x":"Results on a constant currency basis actually increased by 5% as our operating groups benefited from inflation, tariff increases, and GDP linked volume growth rising from solid economic fundamentals in the majority of the regions in which we operate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/06/brookfield-infrastructure-partners-lp-bip-q4-2018.aspx"},{"c":"BIP 2018 Q4","e":"bip","d":"2019-02-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Sam Pollock","x":"Concerns around a potential pullback of the global economy spurred by the threat of a U.S.-China trade war, uncertainties around Brexit, and continued speculation around Federal Reserve policies will continue to persist over the coming months.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/06/brookfield-infrastructure-partners-lp-bip-q4-2018.aspx"},{"c":"BIP 2019 Q1","e":"bip","d":"2019-05-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bahir Manios","x":"The segment benefited from organic growth of 6% driven by higher tariff and traffic levels across our global toll road portfolio, strong volumes at our container terminals and higher revenues at our Australia -- Australian rail operation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/brookfield-infrastructure-partners-lp-bip-q1-2019.aspx"},{"c":"BIP 2019 Q1","e":"bip","d":"2019-05-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bahir Manios","x":"This coupled with strong tariff growth and a favorable tariff regime has resulted in significant value appreciation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/brookfield-infrastructure-partners-lp-bip-q1-2019.aspx"},{"c":"BIP 2019 Q2","e":"bip","d":"2019-08-02","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bahir Manios","x":"Results in the quarter benefited from volume growth across our ports and toll road businesses, as well as rising tariffs, which were 4% higher than those earned in 2018.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/02/brookfield-infrastructure-partners-lp-bip-q2-2019.aspx"},{"c":"BIP 2019 Q2","e":"bip","d":"2019-08-02","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bahir Manios","x":"In Australia, revenue at our container terminal was 8% ahead of the prior year, primarily due to new services that commenced in the second half of 2018 and higher average tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/02/brookfield-infrastructure-partners-lp-bip-q2-2019.aspx"},{"c":"BIP 2019 Q2","e":"bip","d":"2019-08-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bahir Manios","x":"The increase was primarily the result of contributions from new investments that we recently made in a global data center portfolio, as well as the benefits of inflationary price increases and new towers added to the network at our French telecommunication business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/02/brookfield-infrastructure-partners-lp-bip-q2-2019.aspx"},{"c":"BIP 2019 Q2","e":"bip","d":"2019-08-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sam Pollock","x":"And I think this notion that you can't achieve the cost savings is short o